{"t":"Demon Legs","s":"demon-legs-37ee1","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Demon_Legs_abdbeb.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Demon Legs</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Demon Legs\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demon_Legs_abdbeb.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Combat Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"upgradeclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Upgrade Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"armor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Armor</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Body Equipment<br/>Legs</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">70.00 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5,000,000 - 12,000,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">84 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 3, 2000<br/>Version 6.0 Beta</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20050613183755&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demon_Legs_abdbeb.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  demon legs <span class=\"p-attributes\">(Arm:9)</span>.<br/>Classification: 4 Tier: 0.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 70.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Obtainable in <a href=\"#/quest/the-demon-oak-quest\">The Demon Oak Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>They used to be obtainable around the area of the <a href=\"#/quest/demon-helmet-quest\">Demon Helmet Quest</a>, when the quest system consisted of a chest with various items that could only be obtained once. They were meant to spawn after a full <a href=\"#/wiki/Floor%20Reset\">map reset</a> (happens when an Update sends players to temple) but Knightmare forgot to set this and it was abused. Many players completed the quest and got the reward, making the Demon Legs not as rare as they were intended to be. The old Demon Legs quest was replaced by the current <a href=\"#/quest/demon-helmet-quest\">Demon Helmet Quest</a> many years ago.</li>\n<li>Before Update 8.2 these were unobtainable and, therefore, an extremely exclusive item.\n<ul><li>After the update they became a reward for <a href=\"#/quest/the-demon-oak-quest\">The Demon Oak Quest</a>, making the value and rarity decrease.</li>\n<li>This quest sparked a lot of controversy, because many felt that making the Demon Legs a quest reward would destroy a piece of Tibia history.</li>\n<li>The legs were extremely rare and very few people had ever obtained them. Older worlds, such as Antica, Amera, Calmera, Danubia, Eternia, Isara, Libera, Lunara, Rubera, Secura, Nova and Trimera had a pair of demon legs before the update.</li></ul></li>\n<li>With Updates/8.5 CipSoft released a new quest (<a href=\"#/quest/killing-in-the-name-of-quest\">Killing in the Name of... Quest</a>), which allowed players access to the Demon Oak area as a reward, once again allowing players the chance of gaining these legs.</li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Gallery\">Gallery</span></h4>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"fccb6b73605eb8b539202657060fd911\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:150px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Demon_Legs_Quest-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:141px; width:185px; top:3.5px;\"><img alt=\"Old Demon Legs Quest\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Old Demon Legs Quest\" height=\"148\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Demon_Legs_Quest_4933c3.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Demon Legs Quest.jpg (130 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Old Demon Legs Quest</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:150px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Dqcalmera-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:148px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"148\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dqcalmera_fbdfab.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Dqcalmera.jpg (36 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-sellto\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/H.L.\">H.L.</a></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Outlaw%20Camp\">Outlaw Camp</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">84 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Calmera</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Helmet\">Demon Helmet</a></li><li>Demon Set</li><li>Equipment Upgrade</li><li>Full Set</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Golden%20Legs\">Golden Legs</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/H.L.\">H.L.</a></li><li>Level Zero Set</li><li>Quests</li><li>Rare Set</li><li>Shops</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-demon-oak-quest\">The Demon Oak Quest</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["the-demon-oak-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"the-demon-oak-quest","quest":"The Demon Oak Quest","step":"4-2","n":16,"title":"Escolher a recompensa","kind":"reward","coords":[]}],"sell":[{"npc":"H.L.","where":"Outlaw Camp","price":84,"pos":{"x":32643,"y":32212,"z":7},"href":"#/wiki/H.L."}]}}